commit settles
  herd/riverkine . state = pastured
  herd/riverkine `pasturedIn` meadow/lowbank

  event/herd_settled :: a Event
  event/herd_settled `causedBy` contest/cistern_ninefathom_state_1
  event/herd_settled `witnessedBy` npc/keeper
  event/herd_settled . purpose = "brannoc settles the riverkine on the lowbank the folk hold, the herd pastured under gilan's split of the ninefathom, lowbank grass for the season"